    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="56d9c676-58b8-5d11-b763-96c5fc4dfda8" activityNameId="b7883d21-18e1-5656-960f-cdb65e022c81" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Benzaldehyde, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Benzaldehyde, at plant
The process "benzaldehyde, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of benzaldehyde from benzal chloride in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000100-52-7; 
Formula: C7H6O; 
UUID: 6af091c5-06d5-3693-a1a3-6abbb6f31a6e
Production of benzaldehyde including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hydrolysis of benzal chloride
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6af091c5-06d5-3693-a1a3-6abbb6f31a6e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
